<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:55:19 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“无线能源互联网”路线图描绘了无需电池即可实现光、热和运动的路径</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/wireless-energy-internet-roadmap-charts-path-to-light-heat-and-motion-without-batteries</link><description>无线充电已经改变了人们为手机、可穿戴设备甚至电动汽车供电的方式。下一个飞跃是推动无线技术从提供电能到根据实际需要直接产生非电输出，如光能、热能和机械能。这将创建一个像互联网一样灵活高效的能源输送网络。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/wireless-energy-internet-roadmap-charts-path-to-light-heat-and-motion-without-batteries2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:55:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/wireless-energy-internet-roadmap-charts-path-to-light-heat-and-motion-without-batteries</guid></item><item><title>与机器一起梦想</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/dreaming-with-the-machines</link><description>威廉·布莱克（William Blake）的《雅各布之梦》或《雅各布的阶梯》（1805）。公共领域。通过&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/dreaming-with-the-machines.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:40:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/dreaming-with-the-machines</guid></item><item><title>新的人工智能方法利用工程知识来估计不完整卫星图像的灾害损失</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/new-ai-method-uses-engineering-knowledge-to-estimate-disaster-damage-from-incomplete-satellite-imagery</link><description>一项新技术已经开发出来，即使在灾难发生后部分卫星图像被云层或烟雾遮盖的情况下，也可以快速预测城市规模的结构损坏。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-ai-method-uses-engineering-knowledge-to-estimate-disaster-damage-from-incomplete-satellite-imagery3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:25:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/new-ai-method-uses-engineering-knowledge-to-estimate-disaster-damage-from-incomplete-satellite-imagery</guid></item><item><title>致病性 CD4+ T 辅助细胞的代谢重编程可减轻小鼠炎症性肠病</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/metabolic-reprogramming-of-pathogenic-cd4-t-helper-cells-attenuates-inflammatory-bowel-disease-in-mice</link><description>激酶 GSK3β 驱动代谢，支持致病性 TH1 细胞的炎症功能。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/metabolic-reprogramming-of-pathogenic-cd4-t-helper-cells-attenuates-inflammatory-bowel-disease-in-mice2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:10:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/metabolic-reprogramming-of-pathogenic-cd4-t-helper-cells-attenuates-inflammatory-bowel-disease-in-mice</guid></item><item><title>肯德尔·哈文谈故事证明：故事背后的科学</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/kendall-haven-on-story-proof-the-science-behind-story</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/kendall-haven-on-story-proof-the-science-behind-story.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:55:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/kendall-haven-on-story-proof-the-science-behind-story</guid></item><item><title>为什么一些年轻的蚂蚁很早就开始狩猎和照顾其他蚂蚁</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/why-some-young-ants-start-hunting-and-caring-for-others-early</link><description>一些昆虫，包括蜜蜂和蚂蚁，生活在高度组织化的群体中，其中个体扮演着特定的角色。在许多蚂蚁社会中，年轻的成年工蚁通常会在巢外照顾幼蚁的发育，然后再开始在巢外觅食或寻找食物。然而，有些蚂蚁种类一到成年就开始寻找食物，而没有经历过渡期。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-some-young-ants-start-hunting-and-caring-for-others-early2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:40:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/why-some-young-ants-start-hunting-and-caring-for-others-early</guid></item><item><title>尖峰神经网络学习预测将会发生什么、何时发生以及发生的可能性有多大</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/spiking-neural-network-learns-to-predict-what-will-happen-when-and-how-likely-it-is</link><description>想象一下听到熟悉的声音并期待发生什么事。在事件到来之前，大脑可以预测事件会是什么、何时发生以及发生的可能性有多大。然而，计算模型通常单独处理这些问题或使用难以与生物回路协调的学习方法。一项新的研究提出了一种替代方案，即一群尖峰神经元一起学习这三种神经元。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/spiking-neural-network-learns-to-predict-what-will-happen-when-and-how-likely-it-is.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:25:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/spiking-neural-network-learns-to-predict-what-will-happen-when-and-how-likely-it-is</guid></item><item><title>可调节纳米传感器将水压转化为荧光信号，具有刚度整形灵敏度</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/adjustable-nanosensors-turn-water-pressure-into-fluorescent-signals-with-stiffness-shaping-sensitivity</link><description>东京科学研究所开发的一种基于纳米囊泡的新型平台可以通过将压力引起的分子变化转化为荧光信号来测量静水压。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/adjustable-nanosensors-turn-water-pressure-into-fluorescent-signals-with-stiffness-shaping-sensitivity.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:10:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/adjustable-nanosensors-turn-water-pressure-into-fluorescent-signals-with-stiffness-shaping-sensitivity</guid></item><item><title>“自闪烁染料”简化纳米级成像而不牺牲精度</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/self-blinking-dyes-simplify-nanoscale-imaging-without-sacrificing-precision</link><description>纳米抗体是与特定分子结合的极小的抗体片段。当纳米抗体用染料标记时，它们可以用作增强超分辨率显微镜的探针。然而，传统的闪烁染料在附着到纳米抗体上时通常表现不佳，限制了它们的实际优势。由哥廷根大学和哥廷根大学医学中心 (UMG) 领导的一个国际研究小组现已证明，自闪烁染料（可以自行在亮态和暗态之间切换）绕过了这一限制。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/self-blinking-dyes-simplify-nanoscale-imaging-without-sacrificing-precision2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:55:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/self-blinking-dyes-simplify-nanoscale-imaging-without-sacrificing-precision</guid></item><item><title>Bitdefender 就 Android 手机上预装恶意软件的全球活动发出警报</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/bitdefender-alerta-de-una-campana-global-de-malware-preinstalado-en-telefonos-android</link><description>该公司已发现 Midnight Mimosa，这是一个活跃了两年的活动，甚至在首次启动之前就感染了 150 多个国家/地区的数千台设备。该恶意软件嵌入固件中，执行广告欺诈、收集数据并允许远程控制手机。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/bitdefender-alerta-de-una-campana-global-de-malware-preinstalado-en-telefonos-android.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:40:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/bitdefender-alerta-de-una-campana-global-de-malware-preinstalado-en-telefonos-android</guid></item></channel></rss>